<title>LUXEMBOURG: Banque Indosuez Lux 1996 net profit up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Banque Indosuez Lux 1996 net profit up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    418  vs	376</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total	   124,978  vs  109,745</p>
<p>    Private clients deposits     66,537  vs   63,003</p>
<p>    Bank client deposits	   52,342  vs   38,937</p>
<p>    Capital and reserves	    1,500  vs    1,463</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque Indosuez Luxembourg SA, owned by French Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole, has a Aa2 long-term rating from Moody's and AA from Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
